'''A Deeper Dream''' is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 8.10 Update|Version 8.10]] and appears on the 9th, 10th, 23rd, and 24th days of every month. It is unlocked after clearing [[Bombergirl (Deadly)|Bombergirl]]. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first cleared, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Lone Cat and Kitten (Rare Cat)|Lone Cat and Kitten]], Tourist Cat.

